      "writtenOn": "2022-11-01T12:16:21Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "So, the usage here is to caculate the passing time from last call time and to know if it over the POLL_RATE_LIMIT_MS. As Junyu mentioned, the impact of this change is that more polls would be allowed when the time adjustment.\n\naosp/2273088 tried to test restrictFlagsForCaller without change the clock here.",
      "parentUuid": "c9576981_12c03d54",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1307,
        "startChar": 37,
